#: src/fmfontstrings.cpp:337
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This font may be embedded and permanently installed on the remote system by "
"an application. The user of the remote system acquires the identical rights, "
"obligations and licenses for that font as the original purchaser of the "
"font, and is subject to the same end-user license agreement, copyright, "
"design patent, and/or trademark as was the original purchaser."
